#: ../../index.md:3
msgid "`magshield-env` 把显式声明的物理输入（采样区域、响应矩阵或导体几何、硬件限制、外部场与位姿）构建成**经过完整校验、自包含的 Gymnasium 环境包**。它不训练策略，也不调用有限元求解器；构建和加载是两件独立的事。"
msgstr "`magshield-env` turns explicitly declared physical inputs (sampling region, response matrix or conductor geometry, hardware limits, external field, and pose) into a **fully validated, self-contained Gymnasium environment package**. It does not train policies and does not invoke a finite-element solver; building and loading are two independent concerns."

#: ../../index.md:5
msgid "本站按你的角色组织内容："
msgstr "This site is organized around your role:"

#: ../../index.md:7
msgid "**研究人员与工程师**：从[教程](tutorials/tui-first-env)开始，学会用五步向导或构建定义生成环境。"
msgstr "**Researchers and engineers**: start with the [tutorials](tutorials/tui-first-env) to build environments with the five-step wizard or a build definition."

#: ../../index.md:8
msgid "**强化学习开发者**：从[快速开始](getting-started/index)和[Python API](reference/python-api)入手，直接消费环境包。"
msgstr "**Reinforcement-learning developers**: start with [Getting Started](getting-started/index) and the [Python API](reference/python-api) to consume environment packages directly."

#: ../../index.md:9
msgid "**评审与维护者**：[概念](concepts/units-and-formats)解释物理与契约，[架构](architecture/index)说明设计边界。"
msgstr "**Reviewers and maintainers**: [Concepts](concepts/units-and-formats) explain the physics and contracts, and [Architecture](architecture/index) describes the design boundaries."

#: ../../index.md:11
msgid "命令的参数、flag 和默认值只以各命令的 `--help` 为准；本站只解释概念和流程，不复制命令细节。"
msgstr "Command parameters, flags, and defaults are authoritative only in each command's `--help`; this site explains concepts and workflows and never duplicates command details."
